    rdfs:label "sentence 309" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "In experiments using juvenile fish, a circular symmetric nine-channel plastic manifold (Darwin Microfluidics Manifold 9 Ports 1/4-28 PEEK, 1/16” OD) was used to combine the flow of multiple odor channels to the main ACSF perfusion channel." .

