kb:157cd84b-79bb-5e2e-b37d-da07042728f5 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 249" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "This prediction is based on the fact that activity patterns evoked by the same odor at different times or in different trials exhibit considerable variability due to stochastic firing of individual neurons and other physiological, behavioral and environmental factors." .

