    rdfs:label "sentence 283" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "To test the second prediction, we examined changes in correlations between odor-evoked activity patterns as a function of time." .

