    rdfs:label "sentence 207" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Nonetheless, prolonged activity was observed in odor-specific subsets of neurons (Extended Data Fig." .

