    rdfs:label "sentence 174" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "‘Effective’ emphasizes that the measures are analytically connected to the capacity value; hence, this approach can be used to analyze geometrical changes underlying changes in manifold capacity." .

