    rdfs:label "sentence 26" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "These studies further support the assumption that neural manifolds are informative objects critical for neuronal computation, implying that the systematic analysis of manifold geometry can uncover principles of information processing in the brain." .

