kb:619246d6-f00d-59a1-bb94-3b8701b62460 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 275" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The fraction of neurons with persistent activity was higher in trained fish but this effect was not statistically significant." .

kb:6255342e-c0f3-53f2-8c68-fc50e9b9b9a6 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 121" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Manifold capacity predicted odor discrimination across individuals, indicating that representational geometry is linked to behavior." .

kb:62fa5d05-61b2-5cbd-a7b9-4032c4db769c a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 86" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "These results indicate that pDp and, by extension, piriform cortex do not function as pattern classifiers themselves but support odor classification across brain areas." .

