kb:687ab9a9-aa8d-5a19-b63f-07114941263f a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 334" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Variability was significantly higher in pDp (mean ± s.d.: 0.29 ± 0.07, 3 trials; 6 odors; n = 6 fish) than in the olfactory bulb (0.04 ± 0.01; Mann–Whitney U test, two-sided, P = 6.1 × 10−37), contradicting attractor-based predictions." .

