    ner:sentenceText "5 1.0 1.5 2.0 Firing rate (Hz) 0.5 1.0 1.5 2.0 Firing rate (Hz) Naive 0 1 2 3 Mean firing rate (Hz) *** *** *** Individual training ~4 days Acclimate 3 days Group training 11 days Naive Phe+/ Arg– Arg+/ Phe– Phe+/ Trp– CS+ – Arg Phe CS– – Phe Arg Trp Phe Training group Naive (n = 6) Arg+/Phe– (n = 9) Phe+/Trp– (n = 6) Phe+/Arg– (n = 10) 10 –0 10 –1 10 –2 10 –3 10 –4 Naive Phe+/Arg– Arg+/Phe– Phe+/Trp– Fig." .

kb:757ab7a7-cee1-5c3f-aa30-84159979d140 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 488" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "a, Cosine distance between activity patterns evoked by simulated odors (3 A-odors, 3 B-odors; four trials each) in randomly connected networks (“naïve”) and in precisely balanced networks with assemblies representing odors A1 and A2 (“Trained”)." .

kb:764eae49-2efc-5cec-b03e-9affd6128de0 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 15" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "We therefore further explored the hypothesis that odors are represented by experience-dependent neural manifolds in pDp." .

kb:76feafb7-f233-5e40-9fa5-06744c5bcc2d a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 115" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "In other words, the prediction is based on the hypothesis that the dynamics is dominated by intrinsic activity, that is, the system exhibits intrinsic attractor dynamics, as observed in integrator circuits4." .

kb:78635065-a7f4-5974-ab5c-e5378f236dac a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 293" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Three-dimensional (3D) scanning was performed by remote focusing with a volume rate of 7.5 Hz and calcium signals (ΔF/F) were transformed into firing rate estimates using CASCADE43." .

kb:7894f3a1-3da7-5d5f-8615-62639ad0ab5b a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 243" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Capacity analysis of simulated data was performed using a 2-s time window, 1,000 neurons and 50 repeats." .

kb:78db3a98-e1a1-54aa-9a01-e1ce606571b5 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 326" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "In juveniles, the total drift ranged from 10 to 15 μm in pDp and 5 to 10 μm in the olfactory bulb in the z-direction, each region recorded for 80–90 min." .

kb:79fd9342-9129-5a82-b308-16726e2dc1cb a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 327" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "To measure neuronal activity during optogenetic stimulation of the olfactory bulb we scanned single optical planes at higher zoom at a frame rate of 30 Hz." .

