kb:7ac9170f-9ac9-580a-b880-81c32b8e14eb a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 606" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Quantitative analyses of features such as the effective radius, dimension and alignments should thus drive insights into neuronal computations at the population level, similar to analyses of receptive fields at the single-neuron level." .

