    ner:sentenceText "Neurons were targeted using the shadow-patching technique67 as described42, with 0.05 mM Alexa488 or Alexa594 (Invitrogen) included in the internal solution using a custom-designed video-rate multiphoton microscope48." .

kb:8237256a-a8a6-572d-bbaf-cd7e6ee27faa a ner:Sentence ;
