kb:825f0dd5-ad8d-599a-add9-b232096a0956 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 122" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "GLUE theory quantifies the untangledness (‘degree of separability’) of manifolds by the measure of manifold capacity, which is directly linked to geometrical parameters and neuronal covariability (Supplementary Note 1 and ref." .

