    ner:sentenceText "During the group training phase, 10–15 juvenile zebrafish (28–38 dpf) were transferred into a housing tank (Tecniplast 3.5-l tank, ZB30TK) that was continuously perfused with system water (26.5 °C, 120–130 ml min−1 flow rate)." .

