kb:b206a451-df81-563e-9116-8baac2285a1e a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 54" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Rapid olfactory discrimination learning in adult zebrafish." .

kb:b216c69c-9b82-5965-826a-a28b5cab6845 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 227" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Responses of the same neurons were measured in repeated trials with blue light stimulation starting at different interspersed time points (1 s, 2 s and 3.2 s after response onset)." .

kb:b343370a-7755-5bed-9aea-a63949847778 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 297" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Spike probability was inferred using the OGB_zf_pDp_7.5Hz_smoothing200ms model from CASCADE." .

kb:b3655750-63df-569c-a862-e7cf4c0f7152 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 133" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "These measures provide a statistical description of representational manifolds that is linked to manifold capacity through a mathematical characterization of how linear readout interacts with manifold structure." .

kb:b3aaf465-c9f8-531c-9483-d305fef4dd01 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 163" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Hence, training may modify multiple geometrical features of manifolds with opposing effects on manifold capacity." .

