kb:b76f71a3-4e0d-511b-b687-afe9359f1885 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 175" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "For manifold capacity analysis we used the longest time window (7 s starting at response onset) because this analysis preserves individual datapoints and explicitly extracts geometrical information." .

kb:b8f71a20-ff0d-5efb-be1e-c583cbfbebd0 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 104" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Alternatively, classification may be supported by mapping semantically related inputs into a common neural subspace (manifold) in the absence of attractor dynamics." .

kb:ba456d54-d062-5513-ae72-1d504c57fc89 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 89" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "(2) Experimental results in pDp and piriform cortex revealed only minor effects of training on the variability of single-neuron responses or global population activity25,30,31." .

kb:bb503f65-23c4-5e4d-8248-18d94ef69d5f a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 158" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Consistent with this notion, defined manifold features were systematically modified by discrimination training and manifold capacity predicted discrimination behavior across individuals." .

kb:bc34ae1e-ae5a-5378-82dd-9ae3c04bddde a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 9" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Hence, pDp and possibly related recurrent networks store information in the geometry of neural manifolds, resulting in joint sensory and semantic maps that may support distributed learning processes." .

kb:bc7d0bc5-0ec8-5d24-a67c-1c8a6136104c a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 169" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Manifold capacity analysis Data preprocessing and capacity estimation." .

kb:be5d20ec-6f86-5eef-8878-3b3ce600e635 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 314" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Moreover, while convergent dynamics are expected to reduce variability, intra- and inter-trial variability of neuronal activity seems high in comparison to inputs from the olfactory bulb23–26." .

