    rdfs:label "sentence 166" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "For example, manifold capacity was found to increase along the ventral stream of the visual 200 300 400 500 5 10 15 20 r = 0.11 P = 0.60 4 6 8 10 5 10 15 20 r = 0.33 P = 0.11 200 300 400 500 dM CS– → CS+ dM CS+ → CS– 5 10 15 20 r = 0.42 P = 0.04 Discrimination score (behavior) Discrimination score (behavior) r = 0.56 P = 0.004 0.10 0.12 5 10 15 20 dE CS+ CS– Capacity CS+ CS– Phe+/Arg– Arg+/Phe– Phe+/Trp– 0.25 0.30 0.35 0.40 5" .

kb:c00bbfb6-bc02-5ef3-866f-f68251f6afa7 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 233" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Connections between two neurons x and y from populations X and Y, respectively, were drawn from a Bernoulli distribution with parameter pXY." .

kb:c08fbc6d-c839-5a30-8ce6-f1a7f236c516 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 556" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "dM was increased for learned odors specifically in the direction dMA→B (from A-odors to B-odors), indicating that manifold geometry changed non-uniformly (Fig." .

kb:c098263d-edcb-532a-9605-b470f63e77b3 a ner:Sentence ;
