    ner:sentenceText "Bottom: Peri-stimulus time histogram of spiking activity around the time of optical stimulation (blue bar; 4 mitral cells from two fish, 109 trials, 20 ms time bins; inset: zoom-in, 5 ms bins; note rapid silencing)." .

kb:c1789db2-f59e-57da-842b-be50d9e0c980 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 552" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The same procedure was used to determine dM in the opposite direction (dMY→X)." .

