kb:c3ef925b-cc41-507b-93e8-4998dd332bef a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 612" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Pressure injections were targeted using a two-photon scanning microscope with a ×20 objective that provided both a fluorescent channel for detection of OGB-1 (PMT H7422P-40MOD, Hamamatsu) and a transmitted light channel (position-sensitive detector) as described41." .

kb:c5286161-ff27-54c4-998d-af81f06f6402 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 95" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Spatial maps in piriform cortex during olfactory navigation." .

kb:c65f3f9a-a8c4-5e4b-875e-d7e2251e54fc a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 296" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The spike probability of the CASCADE algorithm was converted to firing rate by multiplication with the frame rate." .

kb:c7087bbc-9556-57f4-b4b6-07dc0a34c8ae a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 131" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Rather, manifold capacity measures the ‘suitability’ of representational manifolds to learn pattern classification tasks." .

