kb:c873724d-d1ea-59ee-8139-18ba8899d8ac a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 103" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Convergent intrinsic attractor dynamics may therefore facilitate the classification of different activity patterns representing a common odor." .

kb:c8a5b3a5-6dac-558a-a22e-6ee2fd799eeb a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 215" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "3d,f), which can be attributed to a modest increase in firing rates of neurons within but not outside an assembly32." .

kb:c8bb14e9-d6fd-570f-beed-6268cd40d11a a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 123" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Hence, manifold capacity quantifies the amount of linearly decodable information per neuron as a function of geometry parameters and correlations." .

kb:c9f0d9d4-2615-5021-89e5-cc8614fd65e8 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 354" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "After dissection of the jaws, the eyes, the bones covering the ventral telencephalon and the dura mater over pDp were removed with fine forceps." .

