kb:e3c893fb-2f35-5275-83e7-bbe458868fcb a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 150" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Nature Neuroscience Article https://doi.org/10.1038/s41593-026-02429-3 Analyses using a shorter time window (3 s) revealed that manifold capacity increased during odor presentation and decreased again after odor offset (Fig." .

