kb:f2076d31-f849-5af2-bc1d-f2b572e77ab8 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 581" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The activity pattern of mitral cells for each odor was generated to approximate the response amplitudes and pattern correlations observed in experiments." .

kb:f2c357e8-e448-575e-a7e1-e4f869bb7721 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 493" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "To further explore effects of training we visualized odor representations by projecting population activity onto the first two Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection (UMAP) components." .

kb:f2e3385d-5d03-5693-8a44-26d82937aa72 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 199" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "2a), and responses of individual neurons were scattered throughout pDp without an obvious odor-related topography39." .

kb:f4d314d0-8990-5de8-9f20-04bdc9e1a012 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 178" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "contributed to data analysis (manifold capacity analysis) and participated in writing the paper." .

kb:f53bf8da-5135-5e39-9a77-2bdd4c587035 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 598" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "A decrease in effective center alignment supports pattern classification by decorrelating representations." .

kb:f6c9bf83-d6ce-5389-85c0-6669bf4d8396 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 51" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "High-resolution optical control of spatiotemporal neuronal activity patterns in zebrafish using a digital micromirror device." .

kb:f71d3c2b-90de-53fe-9fbf-573d18351321 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 554" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "dM was also higher between A-odor than between B-odor representations." .

