kb:f918ee9e-d6b3-52ce-9950-afacfd9e1dd6 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 224" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Electrophysiology Patch-clamp recordings of neurons in pDp were performed as described42 using borosilicate pipettes (pipette resistance, 4–8 MΩ) and a Multiclamp 700B amplifier (Molecular Devices)." .

kb:f952801b-ddba-5725-9bd8-a789884c89ce a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 189" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "e, Contributions of geometrical features to manifold capacity as a function of time (means ± s.d.)." .

kb:f9e88674-699b-5a67-9fdf-4b91081d86c3 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 306" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Olfactory conditioning of juvenile fish in their home tank started 28–38 days post-fertilization (dpf)." .

kb:fa904d1b-4dc3-517a-8cef-8735bd9a9731 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 500" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "e, Cross-validation accuracy of pairwise odor classification by LDA as a function of neuron number (subsampling) across training groups (mean ± s.e.m.; n = 50 repeats)." .

kb:faca6a46-e677-5d5f-8673-184e7c39307c a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 269" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Neurons were defined as “persistent” when their persistence index was >0.9 and their pre-offset firing rate was >1.5 Hz." .

