    rdfs:label "sentence 497" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "UMAP and LDA were performed using a time window of intermediate length (5 s starting 1 s after response onset) because activity patterns are not averaged over time but weighted equally." .

