    ner:sentenceText "© The Author(s) 2026 Nature Neuroscience Article https://doi.org/10.1038/s41593-026-02429-3 Methods Animals and transgenic lines Zebrafish (Danio rerio) were raised and kept as groups in a standard facility at 26.5–27.5 °C on a 14:10-h light–dark cycle." .

