    rdfs:label "sentence 319" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "We then simulated responses to six input patterns with response amplitudes and correlations matching the correlations between activity patterns evoked by the experimental panel of amino acid and bile acid odors across mitral cells of the olfactory bulb (Methods)." .

