    rdfs:label "sentence 78" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "To measure the cellular time constant of Dp neurons by direct hyperpolarization, brief voltage steps (500 ms, step size ΔV = −5 mV) were applied through the patch pipette during voltage clamp experiments." .

