kb:4676531c-b283-5f15-975d-fe82367893be a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 198" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Most experiments were performed in juvenile fish (46–56 days after fertilization; 9.0–13.5 mm body length), which allowed us to measure activity across the majority of neurons in pDp." .

