kb:4994e0e9-e2d7-56f4-959b-63cd7581fca6 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 187" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "This reflects the fact that manifold capacity reflects the minimum number of neurons (dimensions) required for classification, independent of the total population size." .

kb:499cd183-ec50-5443-a1a8-fd8e16816d56 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 91" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "pDp and piriform cortex25 do not seem to function as an integrator network or to classify odor objects by convergent attractor dynamics even after learning." .

