kb:985983a7-4ad6-5dfe-a015-7ea7334a33c7 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 164" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The observed increase in manifold capacity implies that fewer neurons are required for efficient classification of conditioned odors after training, that readout becomes more robust, and that it becomes easier to find an acceptable classifier15,37,53." .

