kb:b5b14d0f-2070-5987-aa3d-62c2824285fd a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 537" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "dE between two manifolds X and Y was defined as: dE (X, Y) = √(μX −μY) T(μX −μY) where μX = 1 |X| ∑x∈Xx and μY = 1 |Y| ∑y∈Yy are the centers of the manifolds X and Y, respectively." .

