    rdfs:label "sentence 549" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "dM is defined as dM (x, Y) = √(x −μY) TSY −1 (x −μY) where μY and SY are the mean and the covariance matrix, respectively, of Y." .

