kb:ee82ce5f-a1c7-5e4a-8aa7-60387c263566 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 12" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Discrete attractor states and continuous neural manifolds are extreme however, as geometrical analyses of neuronal population activity remain challenging, the organization and experience-dependent plasticity of representational neural manifolds in memory networks are still poorly understood." .

