    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Acquisition and first-order analysis of video data for behavioral experiments was performed using custom software as described (Namekawa I, Moenig NR, Friedrich RW, Rapid olfactory discrimination learning in adult zebrafish." .

