kb:1577bad4-68ec-5268-a969-62d25fd47710 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 476" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The largest increases were observed between representations of amino acids and bile acids (AA→BA) in the direction from amino acid activity vectors to bile acid reference distributions (dMAA→BA), whereas dM in the opposite direction (dMBA→AA) remained almost constant." .

kb:17ef9307-1843-5210-ae07-7f6ea1200eff a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 149" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Arrows depict how the observed effects of training on each geometric measure affected manifold capacity: decreases in effective radius, dimension and center alignment increased capacity while a decrease in effective axis alignment decreased capacity." .

kb:18e496aa-f86e-539c-8404-93def6038233 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "sentence 230" ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The model of pDp consists of 1,000 excitatory (E) and 250 inhibitory (I) adaptive leaky integrate-and-fire neurons with conductance-based synapses." .

