    ner:sentenceText "Experience-dependent modification of neural dynamics in pDp To examine how odor representations in pDp are modified by experience we trained juvenile zebrafish expressing GCaMP6s50 in the telencephalon in an odor discrimination task using procedures developed for adult fish57 with minor modifications." .

