    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "We measured activity in pDp of trained and naive fish in response to three amino acids (Phe, Arg and Trp) and three bile acids (TDCA, TCA and GCA; 5 s, three trials each), which represent two classes of natural odors for aquatic animals59." .

